    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d954">

                <pb facs="1138" n="1128" sameAs="frus:frus1943v01/pg1128"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">562.8F4/6: Telegram</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">The Ambassador in the United Kingdom</hi> (<hi rendition="#italic">Winant</hi>) <hi
                        rendition="#italic">to the Secretary of State
                    </hi>
                </head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">London</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1943-05-26T10:00:00+02:00">May 26, 1943—10
                            a.m.</date>
                        <lb/> [Received 5:45 p.m.]</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>3628. Department’s 3281, May 24, midnight. Attendance of Cumming and Allison at
                    conference to discuss amendments to the whaling agreement satisfactory to
                    Embassy.</p>
                <p>Foreign Office will let us know date of conference as soon as this has been
                    decided. According Foreign Office date will be some time after June 10th.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">Winant</hi>
                    </signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
